-state the resolver itself produces is the one state in which the guard is never
-called. A node repaired by ingest alone would need a second displayName to
-appear first, which is exactly what #145 now prevents.
-
-Hence a one-off, operator-run repair. It is deliberately NOT wired into any
-pipeline and NOT vendored, the same disposition as reconcile_people_stores.py:
-it touches real contact data and the decision to run it is a person's.
-
-WHAT IT CHANGES, AND WHAT IT WILL NOT
-  - It rewrites `pwg:displayName` and nothing else.
-  - It never DELETEs a triple other than the displayName it is replacing, and
-    never removes a node, an identifier or a givenName.
-  - A node is a candidate ONLY when its stored displayName is exactly the
-    string `_full_name(kinship_given, family)` would assemble -- the compound
