-    python3 -m identity_resolver.repair_kinship_display_names            # dry run
-    python3 -m identity_resolver.repair_kinship_display_names --apply
-    python3 -m identity_resolver.repair_kinship_display_names --apply --include-mononym
-    python3 -m identity_resolver.repair_kinship_display_names --limit 20
-    python3 -m identity_resolver.repair_kinship_display_names --namespace ...
-
-The namespace defaults to the migrated one and is PRINTED on every run. A zero
-from the wrong namespace and a zero from a clean graph are the same three words
-otherwise, which is precisely how #158 hid.
