-  0  ran, and reported (dry run) or applied (with --apply)
-  1  at least one candidate could not be repaired at apply time
-  2  CANNOT-RUN -- the store did not answer, or answered unusably. Never a
-     pass: "no candidates" and "could not look" must not print the same.
